abstract: >
  SOLARA (Solar Analytics & Revenue Advisor) is a comprehensive 
  open-source platform for photovoltaic and battery energy storage 
  system design, optimization, and techno-economic analysis. Built 
  on NREL's validated PySAM models, SOLARA provides professional-grade 
  capabilities for multi-objective optimization, uncertainty 
  quantification, grid services analysis, and NEC 2023 compliance 
  documentation. The platform delivers analysis quality comparable 
  to commercial tools like HOMER Pro and PVsyst while maintaining 
  full transparency and customization through open-source code. Key 
  features include machine learning optimization algorithms, revenue 
  stacking for grid services, advanced battery degradation modeling, 
  Monte Carlo uncertainty analysis, and automated NEC compliance 
  calculations.

